<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Plum Creek Timber started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Plum Creek Timber started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said analyst Matt Berler initiated coverage of Plum Creek Timber Co LP and Crown Pacific Partners LP with outperform ratings.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Crown Pacific rose 1/8 to 22-3/4, while Plum Creek added 1/2 to 29-3/4.</p>
</text>
